Conclusion
In this lab, you performed an end-to-end security control assessment aligned to CGRC Domain 5 practices. You installed OpenSCAP and STIG-based SCAP content, authored an assessment plan with an assessor independence statement, executed automated compliance scans, triaged and remediated real findings, and consolidated everything into a formal Security Assessment Report. This workflow mirrors real-world compliance auditing tasks performed by Cybersecurity Auditors validating whether technical controls are implemented correctly and operating as intended.
